<p>Hello, <%= @resource.email %>!</p>

<p>We received a request to change your password. Please follow the link below to complete the process:</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, :reset_password_token => @resource.reset_password_token) %></p>

<p>If you do not want to change your password, simply disregard this email.</p>

<p>Thank you for being a part of our community! Together, we can enhance the human experience through computing.</p>

<p>Sincerely,</p>
<p>The Code Montage Team</p>